{"id":"189d4400ee8241b4","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-topo9-radial-space.md","title":"ZFC Topo9 Radial Space","display":"df-zfc-topo9-radial-space — ZFC Topo9 Radial Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-radial-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-radial-space"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-radial-space — ZFC Topo9 Radial Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-closure]]","[[58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-net-convergence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-radial-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-radial-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-radial-space — ZFC Topo9 Radial Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closure\">58-df-zfc-top5-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44c6814fd2d8eda0\" href=\"?note=44c6814fd2d8eda0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence\">58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a065fc40b0877dfe\" href=\"?note=a065fc40b0877dfe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-net-convergence\">58-df-zfc-top2-net-convergence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,C,x,\\lambda,s\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A,C,x,\\lambda,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span> (closure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closure\">58-df-zfc-top5-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S\\)</span> (ordinal-indexed-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"44c6814fd2d8eda0\" href=\"?note=44c6814fd2d8eda0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence\">58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2NetConvergence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2NetConvergence}_S\\)</span> (net-convergence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a065fc40b0877dfe\" href=\"?note=a065fc40b0877dfe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-net-convergence\">58-df-zfc-top2-net-convergence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9RadialSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9RadialSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}radial\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9RadialSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\forall C\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\\to\\forall x\\in C\\;\\exists\\lambda\\;\\exists s\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(s,\\lambda,A)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop2NetConvergence}_S(s,x,\\lambda,\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\lambda\\times\\lambda:\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\\},X,\\tau)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}radial\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9RadialSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\forall C\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\\to\\forall x\\in C\\;\\exists\\lambda\\;\\exists s\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(s,\\lambda,A)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop2NetConvergence}_S(s,x,\\lambda,\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\lambda\\times\\lambda:\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\\},X,\\tau)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every point in the closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is the limit of a transfinite sequence from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>; the ordinal inclusion order supplies the directed order of the net.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depe